<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Jay | Agent Systems Architect</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Local-first agent systems and ops tooling under real constraints: consumer GPUs, field connectivity, human review. 10+ years HVAC/ops leadership + agent architecture.">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#0c080f">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&amp;family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500&amp;display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <a href="#main" class="skip-link">Skip to content</a>

    <!-- Atmospheric layers -->
    <div class="grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="vignette" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <!-- Custom cursor -->
    <div class="cursor" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="cursor-dot"></div>
        <div class="cursor-ring"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="cursor-trail" aria-hidden="true"></div>

    <nav class="site-nav" aria-label="Primary navigation">
        <div class="site-nav__inner">
            <a href="#top" class="site-nav__brand" aria-label="jaysystems.dev home">
                <span class="brand-lockup">
                    <span class="brand-name">jay</span><span class="brand-tld">systems.dev</span>
                </span>
                <span class="brand-role">Agent Systems Architect</span>
            </a>
            <div class="site-nav__links">
                <a href="#work">Work</a>
                <a href="#capabilities">Capabilities</a>
                <a href="#systems" id="systems-trigger" data-systems-open>Systems</a>
                <a href="#principles">Principles</a>
                <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </nav>

    <!-- Systems / Second Brain Panel -->
    <div id="systems-panel" class="systems-panel" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="systems-panel-title" hidden>
        <div class="systems-panel__backdrop" data-systems-close></div>
        <div class="systems-panel__content" role="document">
            <header class="systems-panel__header">
                <h2 id="systems-panel-title" class="systems-panel__title">Systems · Second Brain</h2>
                <button type="button" class="systems-panel__close" data-systems-close aria-label="Close systems panel">×</button>
            </header>
            <div class="systems-panel__body">
                <article class="systems-entry">
                    <div class="systems-entry__meta">
                        <span class="systems-entry__index">01</span>
                        <span class="systems-entry__name">AetherForge</span>
                        <span class="systems-entry__status">Wedge A (Mock-verified)</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="systems-entry__sections">
                        <div class="systems-section">
                            <h3 class="systems-section__label">Problem</h3>
                            <p class="systems-section__body">Local agents on 8–16 GB cards fail predictably: runaway generation, context blow-ups, thermal stress, and strategy thrash that OOM the only GPU available.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="systems-section">
                            <h3 class="systems-section__label">Constraints</h3>
                            <p class="systems-section__body">8 GB VRAM budgets, thermal limits, offline field use, and irreversible actions that require human sign-off.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="systems-section">
                            <h3 class="systems-section__label">Architecture Decisions</h3>
                            <p class="systems-section__body">FastAPI control plane with Economic Gatekeeper, thermal/VRAM circuit breakers (503), context ceilings (413), tool discovery, and durable audit logs. Agents negotiate strategy; the plane can refuse unsafe work.</p>
                        </div>
                        <div class="systems-section">
                            <h3 class="systems-section__label">Current Verified State</h3>
                            <p class="systems-section__body">Wedge A verified under Mock engine (CI + no-GPU path). Real Fast-Swap / KV survival on 8 GB remains gated research (Wedge B). No production claim for unproven swap behavior.</p>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </article>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <main id="main">
        <!-- HERO -->
        <section id="top" class="hero">
            <canvas id="particles" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>
            <div class="hero-bg-layer" aria-hidden="true"></div>

            <div class="container hero__grid">
                <div class="hero__main">
                    <div class="hero__intro">
                        <p class="hero__eyebrow">
                            <span>Jay</span>
                            <span aria-hidden="true">·</span>
                            <span>Agent Systems Architect</span>
                        </p>
                        <h1 class="hero__title">
                            Local-first agents<br>
                            under real constraints.
                        </h1>
                    </div>

                    <div class="hero__body">
                        <p class="hero__copy">
                            I design agent systems and ops tooling that run on consumer GPUs, survive intermittent connectivity, and keep humans in the loop. 10+ years leading HVAC and construction crews informs every architecture decision. Observable. Interruptible. Accountable.
                        </p>
                        <div class="hero__actions">
                            <a href="#work" class="button button--primary">View current work</a>
                            <a href="#contact" class="button button--ghost">Start a conversation</a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <aside class="hero__rail" aria-label="Core principles">
                    <dl class="hero__rail-item">
                        <dt>Constraints</dt>
                        <dd>8 GB VRAM budgets, thermal limits, offline field use, and irreversible actions that require human sign-off.</dd>
                    </dl>
                    <dl class="hero__rail-item">
                        <dt>Philosophy</dt>
                        <dd>Start from the messy reality of operations and limited hardware. Demos that ignore constraints are not systems.</dd>
                    </dl>
                    <dl class="hero__rail-item">
                        <dt>Availability</dt>
                        <dd>Select engagements on local-first agents, ops automation for trades, and control planes that stay accountable.</dd>
                    </dl>
